cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, the models or the benchmark, please cite the preprint below."
title: "morisien-embed: text embedding models and evaluation for Mauritian Creole"
abstract: >-
  Training, evaluation and benchmark-construction code for morisien-embed, sentence embedding models
  for Mauritian Creole (Kreol Morisien, ISO 639-3 mfe), together with the MorisienMTBitextMining task
  contributed to MTEB and a hardened out-of-domain retrieval pool built from FLORES+ using the
  released xSIM++ augmentation.
